.Dd November 4, 2026
.Dt CPUIC 4 loongarch64
.Os
.\" .Nm loongarch64/cpuic
.Sh NAME
.Nm cpuic
.Nd LoongArch CPU interrupt controller
.Sh SYNOPSIS
This driver is a standard part of the LoongArch kernel.
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
driver provides the root interrupt controller for LoongArch systems.
It masks, enables, and dispatches CPU-local interrupt sources through
CPU control and status registers.
These sources include external hardware interrupts, the CPU timer,
performance counter overflow, and interprocessor interrupts.
.Pp
On ACPI systems the controller is instantiated by the platform nexus.
On systems using a flattened device tree, it attaches to a node with the
compatible string
.Qq loongson,cpu-interrupt-controller .
.Pp
The driver is required by the CPU timer and the
.Xr eioic 4
interrupt controller.
No driver-specific kernel configuration directive is required.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr acpi 4 ,
.Xr eioic 4 ,
.Xr fdt 4 ,
.Xr hwpmc 4 ,
.Xr loongarch_timer 4 ,
.Xr pch_pic 4
.Sh HISTORY
The
.Nm
driver was added in the LoongArch port of
.Fx 16.0 .
